# Default UI source: local rules; no provider or PayPal requests.
# ChatGPT Plus/Pro: use the app's sign-in and actual model selector; no API key.
# Optional alternative AI: explicitly select Nebius after configuring these.
# NEBIUS_API_KEY=
# NEBIUS_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b
# PayPal Developer Dashboard SANDBOX app. Never use live app credentials.
# Prefer npm run paypal:configure for protected local PayPal storage.
# Legacy environment configuration requires both nonempty values and overrides storage.
# PAYPAL_SANDBOX_CLIENT_ID=
# PAYPAL_SANDBOX_SECRET=
